# Added kan (kakan) robbed with ippatsu alive (engine.md §4.2, rules.md §4.15, §4.26):
# - Pon stays intact, no kan counted, no replacement draw, NO kan dora revealed,
#   and ippatsu SURVIVES -> Riichi + Ippatsu + Chankan combine!
# Setup: Seat 2 discards 4m on turn 1 -> Seat 1 pons 4m (using 44m), discards 9s.
# Seat 2, 3 tsumogiri. Seat 0 declares riichi on turn 2 (reach_accepted, ippatsu alive!).
# Seat 1 draws 4th 4m and declares kakan 4m -> Seat 0 robs it!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 23m 678m 234p 567s 88p + ron 4m (chankan)
#   Yaku: riichi (1) + ippatsu (1) + chankan (1) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 5 han (Mangan).
#   Dora indicators: 7z -> 5z (0 dora); 2nd indicator 3m (-> 4m) is NOT revealed!
#   Ura indicators: 5z -> 6z (0 ura).
#   Dealer ron Mangan = 12000 from Seat 1.
#   Seat 0 paid 1000 stick and recovers it -> net +12000, Seat 1 -12000.

